        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PP3520. Solid Brass 3.5\" x 20\" Door Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLarge size door push plates primarily used in restaurants, warehouses and stores, but are popular in homes as well. Made of .050\" thick high quality solid brass for longevity. Packaged with matching finish brass mounting screws for easy installation. The Push Plate is 3.5\" wide and 20\" long. It is available in an array of different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PP3520-Specifications.gif?v=1704354579\" width=\"498\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Large Solid Brass Door Push Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-heavy-duty-pull-plate-3-1-2-x-20-with-11-inch-handle-deltana-pph3520-dp2575\"><b>Matching Door Pull and Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-push-plate-3-5-inch-x-20-inch-deltana-pp3520u32d\"><b>3.5\" x 20\" Stainless Steel Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana PP3520 Large Door Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PP3520.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PP3520 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
